convex_hulls.bin contains point clouds used as the source for convex hulls,
taken from Horizon Zero Dawn. It is copied unchanged from Jolt Physics v5.6.0
(https://github.com/jrouwe/JoltPhysics, Assets/convex_hulls.bin). Its asset
notice states that Guerrilla Games granted permission to release it under the
same MIT license as the rest of Jolt Physics, which follows.

